  "description": {
    "en": "The Tecnifibre FIRE 305S is the top competition model in the FIRE range, combining controllable power, maximum maneuverability and exceptional comfort. It features a 98 sq.in head, 305 g unstrung weight, 315 mm balance and open 16x19 string pattern. X-DAMP technology uses a steel component inside an elastomer pocket in the handle to move against impact vibrations, reducing harmful vibration by 36% and helping reduce arm fatigue. Compared with the previous FIRE generation, the frame sections are more square and approximately 12% thinner, while weight has been redistributed toward the center of the frame to reduce swingweight and improve racquet-head acceleration.",

    "zh": "Tecnifibre FIRE 305S 是 FIRE 系列中面向高水平竞技球员的旗舰型号，强调可控力量、快速操控与高舒适性。球拍采用98平方英寸拍面、305克空拍重量、315毫米平衡点及16×19开放式线床。核心 X-DAMP 技术通过在手柄内部设置钢制部件与弹性体结构，使其在击球时产生反向运动，从而减少约36%的有害震动并降低手臂疲劳。相比上一代 FIRE，拍框截面更接近方形且整体薄约12%，同时将重量从拍框两端向中心重新分配，以降低挥重并提升拍头加速能力，使其更符合现代网球对快速挥拍与高效率击球的需求。"
  },

